OL,3,ALandline switchover could cut people
OL,4,Aoff in emergency, minister warned
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to switch off the UK's
OL,7,Ftraditional landline phone network
OL,8,Fcould leave people in remote areas
OL,9,Funable to contact help in an emergency,
OL,10,FMPs have warned.
OL,12,FLandline operators aim to complete the
OL,13,Fswitch to an internet-based network
OL,14,Finstead of copper-wire cables by the
OL,15,Fend of January next year.
OL,17,FThe government and operators say the
OL,18,Fmove to digital landlines will offer a
OL,19,Fmore reliable service.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
