OL,3,ALandline switchover could cut people
OL,4,Aoff in emergency, minister warned
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut MPs representing remote areas of
OL,7,Fthe UK urged security minister Dan
OL,8,FJarvis to ensure that scrapping the
OL,9,Fcopper-wire network did not make their
OL,10,Fcommunities more vulnerable in a storm
OL,11,For other emergency.
